      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Visitor register",
      "snippet": "## Visitor register\n\nArchive visitors sign a paper register retained for fourteen months. The register is kept at the reception desk.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "a02d2d045fed0985f2b1cfbe67c09fd85a1cc405874d29a567168fbfd01cb54b",
